{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53018","headline":"游南雁荡 · 路应","name":"游南雁荡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁荡峯高岂易梯，筇鞋极处与天齐。\n蟾宫隐隐步将到，日驾亭亭手可提。\n织女支机堪索石，仙翁花雨不沾泥。\n诗怀到此清如许，欲向银河蘸笔题。\n（见周喟《南雁荡山志》卷七《诗外编》引陈玭《嘉靖南雁荡山志》）（按：路应诗及小传皆承张靖同志录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"路应","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}